      "text": "Center of Gravity for fleet and source of Scientific/Engineering \nThe Gefion is a modified Northampton class Frigate fitted for carrier work, with abbreviated\nrunway/launch strips on either side of the vessel.\n\nThe Aureole annex is a miniature Island-type habitation and emigration vessel. While a sixth smaller\nthan contemporary  ",
